{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>You shall not keep overnight.</b> It is written in Torat Kohanim: \"I have only the wages of a man, the wages of an animal, and the wages of lands — from where do I derive? Scripture says: לא תלין פעולת שכיר — behold, everything is included.\" From here one may learn that one who rents a house or an animal from his fellow and withholds its payment transgresses בל תלין. And our Talmud does not mention lands at all."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:18.047905301Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}